        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/afd867b4c/datasets/thompson_1917/t1917-019/README.md#L1-L60> .

    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> a pk:Model ;
